  "interpretation": "The direct ten-to-ten bridge showed a modest relationship: Spearman rho was 0.255 for 2024/25 GW29-38 points against 2025/26 GW1-10 points, versus 0.274 for the full 2024/25 season. Late-season level retained independent predictive value after controlling for GW1-28; raw acceleration did not show a reliable positive relationship. Cross-validated R-squared changed from 0.058 to 0.087 when the final-ten rate was added. The evidence supports Exit Velocity as a modest recency and role signal, not a claim that momentum itself survives the summer."
